WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.250 --> 00:00:07.709
"Forgive me, ma'am, but very few unaccompanied ladies travel beyond Omaha."

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:11.200
"Then they are missing some rare beauty."

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.777
"You're not a soldier's wife?"

00:00:12.777 --> 00:00:13.855
"No. I'm a painter."

00:00:13.855 --> 00:00:14.538
"A painter?"

00:00:14.538 --> 00:00:15.038
"Yes."

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:19.008
"Darlin', I don't mean to be presumptuous, but you do have that certain look."

00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:21.620
"What look is that?"

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.529
"The look of someone filled with good intentions...

00:00:22.529 --> 00:00:24.529
...Western Missouri can be lethal."

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:28.529
"She came all the way from New York to paint Indians."

00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:31.274
"I'm going to paint the Great Sioux chief, Sitting Bull."

00:00:31.274 --> 00:00:32.430
"Is that a fact?" (spits)

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.979
"I have traveled many miles from the east, across many rivers and hills for the honor of speaking with you."

00:00:39.490 --> 00:00:46.109
"You got a train from New York, right?

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.380
"Yes."

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.380
"Thanks."

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.324
"You're not good at keeping still, are you?"

00:00:53.324 --> 00:00:57.059
"Shoot me, then I will be still."

00:00:57.059 --> 00:00:57.850
"What would be the point of shooting you?...

00:00:57.850 --> 00:00:59.850
...Bullets don't seem to have any effect."

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:04.919
"This is what's in my vision... My soldiers falling from the sky... Custer with his army..."

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:08.800
...They tracked down every chief. Killed them all."

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:09.612
"Except for you."

00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:11.519
"The only battle I ever fought against is insignificance."

00:01:12.340 --> 00:01:13.340
"So live more."

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:14.340
"That's what I want to do."

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:17.620
(whisper) "You look so magnificent."

00:01:18.060 --> 00:01:24.440
"[unclear]. Do not give him reason to hope. No one here has forgotten or forgiven, least of all the Seventh Calvary."

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:27.569
"This ain't over until Sittin' Bull is dead."

00:01:29.229 --> 00:01:31.949
"They will think that you and me are planning some kind of uprising."

00:01:32.740 --> 00:01:37.710
"The people need a sign for them to believe in their own strength. They've been angry for a long time."

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:41.760
"Our fear is that his return to Dakota is about revenge."

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:44.640
"You idiots in Washington want to start another war."

00:01:46.030 --> 00:01:48.750
"If we fight, don't massacre us all."

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:53.700
"This is what the General wanted all along. And deep down, that's what the Bull wants, too."

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:56.880
"I know terrible things have happened here in the past...

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.600
...I'm just here to paint the painting."

